activity Request Return
activity Approve Return
activity Generate Return Label
activity Ship Item Back
activity Receive Item
activity Inspect Item
activity Determine Refund
activity Process Refund
activity Restock Item
activity Dispose Item
bind Request Return: Return Status, Return Reason, Days Since Purchase
bind Approve Return: Return Status
bind Inspect Item: Item Condition, Inspection Score
bind Process Refund: Refund Amount, Return Status
Return Status: Requested, Approved, Rejected, Shipped, Received, Inspected, Refunded, Restocked, Disposed
Return Reason: Defective, Damaged, Wrong Item, No Longer Needed
Days Since Purchase: integer between 0 and 365
Item Condition: integer between 1 and 5
Inspection Score: integer between 1 and 10
Refund Amount: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Init[Request Return] | |
Response[Request Return, Approve Return] | | |0,24,h
Alternate Succession[Approve Return, Generate Return Label] | | |
Alternate Precedence[Ship Item Back, Generate Return Label] | | |
Response[Ship Item Back, Receive Item] | | |
Succession[Inspect Item, Determine Refund] | | |
Alternate Succession[Determine Refund, Process Refund] | | |
Response[Receive Item, Inspect Item] | | |0,48,h
Response[Receive Item, Process Refund] | | |0,7,d
Precedence[Restock Item, Inspect Item] |A.Item Condition > 3 | |
Precedence[Dispose Item, Inspect Item] |A.Item Condition <= 3 | |
Responded Existence[Restock Item, Process Refund] | | |
Responded Existence[Dispose Item, Process Refund] | | |
Precedence[Inspect Item, Request Return] |A.Return Reason is Defective AND A.Inspection Score <= 5 | |